From: Local PanVK build
Subject: [PATCH] panfrost: Enable Kraid by default on Valhall

Kraid is available on Valhall and later when panfrost-rust is enabled. Keep
PAN_USE_KRAID available as an explicit per-process override.

---
 src/panfrost/compiler/pan_compiler.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/panfrost/compiler/pan_compiler.c b/src/panfrost/compiler/pan_compiler.c
index 8c99ff4282a..f4e321860c1 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/compiler/pan_compiler.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/compiler/pan_compiler.c
@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@ static const struct debug_named_value pan_use_kraid_flags[] = {
 };
 
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_FLAGS_OPTION(use_kraid, "PAN_USE_KRAID",
-                            pan_use_kraid_flags, 0)
+                            pan_use_kraid_flags, USE_KRAID_ALL)
 #endif
 
 bool
-- 
2.47.2
